Feature: Documentation
  In order to know the documentation was generated
  As a developer
  I need to be able to get pages in browser

  Scenario: I GET ApiDoc
    When I send a GET request to "/api/v2/doc"
    Then the response status code should be 200

  Scenario: I GET slate
    When I send a GET request to "/api/v2/man"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And I follow "Autogenerated docs"
    Then I should be on "/api/v2/doc"



